        "description": {
          "value": "<p>When you use a med kit to heal, you add your Proficiency bonus to the healed amount. In addition, you may use a med kit to heal a wounded team member as an action (rather than during a short rest). Med kits cannot heal the target again until after a short rest.</p>"
