          "value": "<p>You may administer a sedative to a living target as a melee attack using your Med Kit. If successful, the target must succeed at a Constitution save (DC equal to 10 + Proficiency bonus + Wisdom modifier) or suffer 1d6 levels of fatigue. A target brought to 6 levels of fatigue with this ability is unconscious instead of dead.</p>"
